169	// loadFixture ingests a six-span trace out of order (children first) so that
170	// deferred validation is exercised on every run. Direct children of a span
171	// never overlap, which is what keeps self_time exact:
172	//
173	//	gateway    0–1000    self 100
174	//	└─ auth    100–300   self 200
175	//	└─ db      350–950   self 150
